{"case_type":"bug","completed_checks":["the console shows no error"],"context_truncated":false,"evidence":[{"header_spans":[],"id":"issue:11266:v3:child:02430ca0212480f1511f","kind":"issue","product_version":null,"quote_candidates":[{"quote_id":"q1","text":"[IMAGE OMITTED: not inspected]"},{"quote_id":"q2","text":"What you see is what I get after clicking "Update", not "rerun". When I click "rerun", I get the inconsistency.  It behaves the same whether or not the text input is in focus."},{"quote_id":"q3","text":"I get both values still. Can you try with the latest nightly? `pip install streamlit-nightly` might need to uninstall Streamlit."},{"quote_id":"q4","text":"I'm getting the same behaviour with the nightly build. I played around and found that it also happens outside a fragment:"},{"quote_id":"q5","text":"```
